			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Adjust the blocks to swap based on your VRAM, this is a tradeoff between speed and memory usage.\n\nIMPORTANT!\nWhen at least 1 VACE block is swapped, the intermediate outputs are also offloaded reducing VRAM usage considerably\n\n根据您的VRAM调整要交换的块，这是速度和内存使用之间的权衡。\n\n重要!\n\n当至少交换1个VACE块时，中间输出也被卸载，从而大大减少了VRAM的使用"
